## Technologies & Innovations

Core Pirelli proprietary technologies for car tyres.  
For detailed explanations, refer to the global “Tech & Knowledge” hub:

**Main Hub:** [Technologies Overview](https://www.pirelli.com/tires/en-us/car/tech-and-knowledge)

### Key Technologies
- [**PNCS™ – Pirelli Noise Cancelling System™**](https://www.pirelli.com/tires/en-us/car/tech-and-knowledge/pncs-tire-noise-cancelling-with-foam)
  Reduces road noise inside the vehicle.
- [**Run Flat™**](https://www.pirelli.com/tires/en-us/car/tech-and-knowledge/run-flat)
  Allows continued driving even after a puncture.
- [**Seal Inside™**](https://www.pirelli.com/tires/en-us/car/tech-and-knowledge/seal-inside)
  Automatically seals punctures to maintain pressure.
- [**Elect™**](https://www.pirelli.com/tires/en-us/car/tech-and-knowledge/elect)
  Designed for electric and hybrid vehicles.
- [**Cyber™ Tyre**](https://www.pirelli.com/tires/en-us/car/tech-and-knowledge/cyber-tire)
  Smart connected tyre technology with embedded sensors.
- [**Marked Tires**](https://www.pirelli.com/tires/en-us/car/tech-and-knowledge/custom-tires)
  Original Equipment marked tires for specific car models.

